IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `jp-ai-domain`
IMPORT `jp-ai-articles`
IMPORT `jp-ai-operator`

-- Japan: Act No. 53 of 2025 (令和七年法律第五十三号) -- THE BASELINE: the
-- business operator's questions.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice. No domain expert and no lawyer qualified in
-- Japan has read this encoding against the source.
--
-- SEAT: a business operator that develops, provides or uses AI-related
-- technology (the Act's 活用事業者). Every question takes plain inputs, one per
-- fact the business can state, and builds the records the rules expect in its
-- WHERE; no rule is restated here. Where the Act leaves a fact to an official
-- (the day a Cabinet Order fixed, whether a request is made under Article 4),
-- the business is asked what it was told, and the answer says which reading it
-- took. Nothing here is new law.

§ `Does this Act apply to my business?`

@export Am I a "utilization business operator" (活用事業者) under Article 7 of Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025)? This is the only class of business the Act addresses by name.
GIVEN `we develop or provide AI products or services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop or provide, or intend to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology?
      `we use AI in our business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use, or intend to use, the technology in your business activities?
      `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology necessary for realizing a function that substitutes, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement (Article 2, first limb)?
      `it is a system that processes input with such technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology part of an information processing system that processes input information using such technology and outputs the result (Article 2, second limb)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Am I a utilization business operator` `we develop or provide AI products or services` `we use AI in our business` `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` `it is a system that processes input with such technology` MEANS
    `Article 7: a utilization business operator` `my business` `my technology`
    WHERE
        `my business` MEANS `The business` WITH
            `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS `we develop or provide AI products or services`
            `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS `we use AI in our business`
            -- Placeholders: Article 7's definition does not read these fields.
            `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
            `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE
        `my technology` MEANS `The technology` WITH
            `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement`
            `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS `it is a system that processes input with such technology`

§ `Reporting an AI incident`

@export Must I report an AI-related incident, or a case where people's rights were infringed by AI, to the government under Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025)? Answers from the Act's text: whether any provision places a reporting duty on a business, and whether the case is one the national government itself is to analyze under Article 16.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about (everything but Chapters III and IV took effect on promulgation, 2025-06-04).
      `people's rights were infringed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were citizens' rights and interests infringed in the incident?
      `it involved a wrongful purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the incident arise from research, development or use of the technology for a wrongful purpose?
      `it involved an inappropriate method` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the incident arise from research, development or use of the technology by an inappropriate method?
GIVETH A `Reporting answer`
`Must I report an AI incident to the government under this Act` `the date` `people's rights were infringed` `it involved a wrongful purpose` `it involved an inappropriate method` MEANS
    `must the business report the incident` `the date` `the incident` `the provisions of the Act`
    WHERE
        `the incident` MEANS `The incident` WITH
            `citizens' rights and interests were infringed` IS `people's rights were infringed`
            `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology for a wrongful purpose` IS `it involved a wrongful purpose`
            `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology by an inappropriate method` IS `it involved an inappropriate method`

§ `Cooperating with the government`

@export Must my business cooperate with a government measure under Article 7 of Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025)? Article 7 says a utilization business operator "must cooperate" (協力しなければならない) with measures the national government implements under Article 4 and a local government implements under Article 5; the Act states no sanction for not cooperating.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
      `we develop or provide AI products or services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop or provide, or intend to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology?
      `we use AI in our business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use, or intend to use, the technology in your business activities?
      `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology necessary for realizing a function that substitutes, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement?
      `it is a system that processes input with such technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology part of an information processing system that processes input information using such technology and outputs the result?
      `the national government implements it under Article 4` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the measure one the national government implements under Article 4 of the Act (its measures to promote AI research, development and use)?
      `a local government implements it under Article 5` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the measure one a local government implements under Article 5 of the Act?
GIVETH AN `Article 7 cooperation answer`
`Must I cooperate with this government measure` `the date` `we develop or provide AI products or services` `we use AI in our business` `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` `it is a system that processes input with such technology` `the national government implements it under Article 4` `a local government implements it under Article 5` MEANS
    `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `the date` `my business` `my technology` `the measure`
    WHERE
        `my business` MEANS `The business` WITH
            `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS `we develop or provide AI products or services`
            `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS `we use AI in our business`
            -- Placeholders: Article 7 does not read these fields.
            `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
            `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE
        `my technology` MEANS `The technology` WITH
            `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement`
            `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS `it is a system that processes input with such technology`
        `the measure` MEANS `The measure` WITH
            `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS `the national government implements it under Article 4`
            `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS `a local government implements it under Article 5`
            -- Placeholder: Article 7 does not read this field.
            `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS FALSE

@export What does Article 7 of Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025) ask my business to endeavor to do? Article 7's first limb is an endeavor (努める), not a duty with a consequence.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
      `we develop or provide AI products or services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop or provide, or intend to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology?
      `we use AI in our business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use, or intend to use, the technology in your business activities?
      `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology necessary for realizing a function that substitutes, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement?
      `it is a system that processes input with such technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology part of an information processing system that processes input information using such technology and outputs the result?
GIVETH AN `Article 7 endeavor answer`
`What must I endeavor to do under Article 7` `the date` `we develop or provide AI products or services` `we use AI in our business` `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` `it is a system that processes input with such technology` MEANS
    `Article 7: what the business is to endeavor to do` `the date` `my business` `my technology`
    WHERE
        `my business` MEANS `The business` WITH
            `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS `we develop or provide AI products or services`
            `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS `we use AI in our business`
            -- Placeholders: Article 7 does not read these fields.
            `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
            `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE
        `my technology` MEANS `The technology` WITH
            `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement`
            `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS `it is a system that processes input with such technology`

-- Only for a business that is also a research and development institute.
@export If my business is also a research and development institute, what does Article 6 of Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025) ask of it? Article 6 asks institutes to endeavor, including to "endeavor to cooperate" (協力するよう努める) with government measures, which is weaker than Article 7's "must cooperate".
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
      `we are a research and development institute` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your business a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology?
      `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology necessary for realizing a function that substitutes, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement?
      `it is a system that processes input with such technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology part of an information processing system that processes input information using such technology and outputs the result?
GIVETH AN `Article 6 answer`
`What does Article 6 ask of my business as a research and development institute` `the date` `we are a research and development institute` `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` `it is a system that processes input with such technology` MEANS
    `Article 6: what the business is to endeavor to do as a research and development institute` `the date` `my business` `my technology`
    WHERE
        `my business` MEANS `The business` WITH
            -- Placeholders: Article 6 does not read these three fields.
            `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS FALSE
            `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS FALSE
            `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE
            `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS `we are a research and development institute`
        `my technology` MEANS `The technology` WITH
            `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement`
            `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS `it is a system that processes input with such technology`

-- Only once the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters exists (Chapter IV).
@export Can Japan's Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters ask my business for cooperation under Article 25 of the AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025), and must I give it? Article 25 states no duty to comply; the answer says when Article 7's duty to cooperate may apply instead.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
      `I know the day the Cabinet Order fixed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know the day a Cabinet Order fixed for Chapters III and IV of the Act to take effect? (Answer no if unsure; from 4 September 2025 the day is not needed.)
      `the day the Cabinet Order fixed` IS A DATE @desc If you know it, the day the Cabinet Order fixed for Chapters III and IV to take effect (ignored otherwise). A day outside the three months the Act allows is flagged, not used.
      `we develop or provide AI products or services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop or provide, or intend to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology?
      `we use AI in our business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use, or intend to use, the technology in your business activities?
      `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology necessary for realizing a function that substitutes, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement?
      `it is a system that processes input with such technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the technology part of an information processing system that processes input information using such technology and outputs the result?
      `Article 25(1) lists us` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the head of a relevant administrative body, a local government, an incorporated administrative agency or a local incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation (a corporation set up directly by law, or by a special act of incorporation under a special law, that comes under Article 4(1)(viii) of the Act for Establishment of the Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications)?
      `the request is an Article 4 measure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the request been made as a measure the national government implements under Article 4 of the Act? (Answer no if you were not told so.)
GIVETH AN `Article 25 answer`
`Can the Headquarters ask me for cooperation` `the date` `I know the day the Cabinet Order fixed` `the day the Cabinet Order fixed` `we develop or provide AI products or services` `we use AI in our business` `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement` `it is a system that processes input with such technology` `Article 25(1) lists us` `the request is an Article 4 measure` MEANS
    `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `the date` `the Cabinet Order day` `my business` `my technology` `the request`
    WHERE
        `the Cabinet Order day` MEANS
            IF   `I know the day the Cabinet Order fixed`
            THEN JUST `the day the Cabinet Order fixed`
            ELSE NOTHING
        `my business` MEANS `The business` WITH
            `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS `we develop or provide AI products or services`
            `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS `we use AI in our business`
            `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS `Article 25(1) lists us`
            -- Placeholder: Article 25 does not read this field.
            `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
        `my technology` MEANS `The technology` WITH
            `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS `it substitutes human cognition, inference or judgement`
            `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS `it is a system that processes input with such technology`
        `the request` MEANS `The measure` WITH
            `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS `the request is an Article 4 measure`
            `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS TRUE
            -- Placeholder: Article 25 does not read this field.
            `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS FALSE

§ `What the government can and cannot do to my business under this Act`

@export What may Japan's national government do toward my business under Article 16 of the AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025), and must I follow it? Article 16 has the national government research AI and analyze cases where rights are infringed, then give guidance, advice and information.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
GIVETH AN `Article 16 answer`
`What may the national government do toward me under Article 16` `the date` MEANS
    `Article 16: what the national government is to do toward the business` `the date`

@export Can my business be fined or otherwise penalised under Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025)? Answered by searching every provision of the Act; other Japanese laws are not covered.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about (the answer does not depend on it).
GIVETH A `Penalty answer`
`Can I be fined or penalised under this Act` `the date` MEANS
    `can the business be penalised, reading` `the provisions of the Act`

@export Can the government publicly name my business under Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025)? Answered by searching every provision of the Act; the Act's only use of "make public" (公表) is for the AI Basic Plan.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about (the answer does not depend on it).
GIVETH A `Naming answer`
`Can the government publicly name me under this Act` `the date` MEANS
    `can the business be named, reading` `the provisions of the Act`

@export Can the government investigate or inspect my business, give it orders, or require it to comply with a request under Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025)? Answered by searching every provision of the Act.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about (the answer does not depend on it).
GIVETH AN `Orders answer`
`Can the government investigate or order me under this Act` `the date` MEANS
    `can the business be investigated or ordered, reading` `the provisions of the Act`

§ `When the Act applies`

@export Was the main part of Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025), everything except Chapters III and IV, in force on a given date? It took effect on the day of promulgation, 2025-06-04 (Supplementary Provisions Article 1).
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
GIVETH A `Commencement`
`Was the main part of the Act in force` `the date` MEANS
    `commencement of the main provisions on` `the date`

@export Were Chapters III and IV of Japan's AI Promotion Act (Act No. 53 of 2025), the AI Basic Plan and the AI Strategic Headquarters, in force on a given date? They take effect on a day fixed by Cabinet Order within three months of promulgation, so from 4 September 2025 at the latest, whether or not the day is known.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
      `I know the day the Cabinet Order fixed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know the day a Cabinet Order fixed for Chapters III and IV of the Act to take effect? (Answer no if unsure; from 4 September 2025 the day is not needed.)
      `the day the Cabinet Order fixed` IS A DATE @desc If you know it, the day the Cabinet Order fixed for Chapters III and IV to take effect (ignored otherwise). A day outside the three months the Act allows is flagged, not used.
GIVETH A `Commencement`
`Were Chapters III and IV in force` `the date` `I know the day the Cabinet Order fixed` `the day the Cabinet Order fixed` MEANS
    `commencement of Chapters III and IV on` `the date` `the Cabinet Order day`
    WHERE
        `the Cabinet Order day` MEANS
            IF   `I know the day the Cabinet Order fixed`
            THEN JUST `the day the Cabinet Order fixed`
            ELSE NOTHING
